{% doc %}
  @prompt
    ### Shopify AI Prompt — Blog / Insights Section
    
    Create a premium dark-themed **"Blog / Insights"** section that closely matches the reference UI.
    
    ### Section Layout
    
    * Full-width section
    * Background: **#000000**
    * Max content width: **1320px**
    * Center the content
    * Top padding: **90px**
    * Bottom padding: **100px**
    * Horizontal padding:
    
      * Desktop: 24px
      * Tablet: 20px
      * Mobile: 16px
    
    ### Heading
    
    Center aligned.
    
    Title:
    
    **Insights for**
    **Ecommerce Growth**
    
    Typography:
    
    * Font weight: 800
    * Desktop: 64px
    * Tablet: 48px
    * Mobile: 34px
    * Line height: 1.05
    * Letter spacing: -2px
    
    Colors:
    
    * "Insights for" → #FFFFFF
    * "Ecommerce" → #9CCB2F
    * "Growth" → #FFFFFF
    
    Spacing below heading: 50px
    
    ---
    
    ## Blog Posts — IMPORTANT
    
    The section must display **only 3 or 4 blog posts maximum**.
    
    Add a Shopify Theme Editor setting called:
    
    **Number of blog posts**
    
    Allow the merchant to choose:
    
    * 3 posts
    * 4 posts
    
    Default: **3 posts**
    
    Do NOT automatically display more than 4 posts.
    
    Connect the section dynamically to the Shopify Blog/Articles system.
    
    The merchant should be able to select which **Blog** is displayed from the Theme Editor.
    
    ---
    
    ## Blog Layout Setting
    
    Add another Theme Editor setting called:
    
    **Blog layout**
    
    Options:
    
    * 3 columns
    * 4 columns
    * Horizontal row
    
    Default: **3 columns**
    
    ### 3 Columns
    
    Display 3 blog cards in one row on desktop.
    
    ### 4 Columns
    
    Display 4 blog cards in one row on desktop.
    
    ### Horizontal Row
    
    Display the selected 3 or 4 posts in a single horizontal row with horizontal scrolling if necessary.
    
    On mobile, automatically switch to a **single-column layout** or horizontal swipe layout for better usability.
    
    ---
    
    ## Blog Cards
    
    Each card should have:
    
    * Background: #121212
    * Border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)
    * Border radius: 18px
    * Overflow: hidden
    * Smooth 0.3s ease transition
    
    Hover:
    
    * Card moves upward by 6px
    * Border becomes slightly brighter
    * Image zooms to 1.05
    
    ---
    
    ## Featured Image
    
    Use the Shopify blog/article featured image.
    
    * Width: 100%
    * Desktop height: 230px
    * Mobile height: 220px
    * Object-fit: cover
    * Rounded top corners
    
    Use a clean placeholder if the article does not have an image.
    
    ---
    
    ## Category Badge
    
    Position on the top-left of the image.
    
    * Background: #ECECEC
    * Text: #8DB62E
    * Padding: 8px 16px
    * Border radius: 999px
    * Font size: 13px
    * Font weight: 600
    
    Use the article's first available tag as the category.
    
    ---
    
    ## Card Content
    
    Padding: 24px
    
    ### Date
    
    * Color: #7B7B7B
    * Font size: 14px
    * Font weight: 400
    * Margin bottom: 20px
    
    Use the Shopify article published date.
    
    ### Blog Title
    
    * Color: #FFFFFF
    * Font size: 38px
    * Font weight: 700
    * Line height: 1.25
    * Maximum 3 lines
    
    ### Description
    
    * Color: #A7A7A7
    * Font size: 18px
    * Line height: 1.7
    * Maximum 3 lines
    * Margin bottom: 30px
    
    Use the Shopify article excerpt if available. Otherwise generate the excerpt from the article content.
    
    ### Read More
    
    Display:
    
    **Read More →**
    
    * Color: #9CCB2F
    * Font size: 17px
    * Font weight: 600
    
    The entire card should be clickable and link to the corresponding Shopify article.
    
    On hover, animate the arrow slightly to the right.
    
    ---
    
    ## Dynamic Shopify Content
    
    Pull content dynamically from Shopify Articles.
    
    Each card should display:
    
    1. Featured image
    2. Article tag/category
    3. Published date
    4. Article title
    5. Article excerpt
    6. Read More link
    
    Only render the number of articles selected in the **Number of blog posts** setting.
    
    Maximum allowed: **4 articles**.
    
    ---
    
    ## Theme Editor Controls
    
    Make the following settings available in the Shopify Theme Editor:
    
    ### Content
    
    * Blog selector
    * Number of blog posts: 3 / 4
    
    ### Layout
    
    * Layout: 3 columns / 4 columns / Horizontal row
    
    ### Styling
    
    * Section background color
    * Accent color
    * Card border radius
    * Card spacing
    
    Do not hard-code these values if they can reasonably be exposed as Theme Editor settings.
    
    ---
    
    ## Responsive Behavior
    
    ### Desktop
    
    For **3 columns**:
    3 cards in one row.
    
    For **4 columns**:
    4 cards in one row.
    
    For **Horizontal row**:
    All selected posts remain in one horizontal row and can horizontally scroll if the viewport is too narrow.
    
    ### Tablet
    
    Automatically adapt the card width while maintaining a clean layout.
    
    ### Mobile
    
    Use one card per row OR horizontal swipe depending on the selected layout.
    
    Do not create a large vertical list of blog posts.
    
    ---
    
    ## Animations
    
    When the section enters the viewport:
    
    * Fade-up animation
    * Duration: 700ms
    * Cards stagger by 120ms
    
    Hover:
    
    * Card lifts slightly
    * Image zooms to 1.05
    * Arrow moves right
    * Border becomes brighter
    
    Keep animations subtle and premium.
    
    ---
    
    ## Overall Design
    
    Maintain the premium editorial aesthetic:
    
    * Pure black background: #000000
    * Dark charcoal cards: #121212
    * White typography
    * Lime green accent: #9CCB2F
    * Rounded 18px cards
    * Generous whitespace
    * Editorial/magazine-inspired design
    * Minimal UI
    * No heavy shadows
    * Subtle borders
    * Smooth interactions
    * Fully responsive
    
    ### IMPORTANT IMPLEMENT
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% liquid
  assign selected_blog = block.settings.blog
  assign posts_count = block.settings.posts_count
  assign layout_type = block.settings.layout_type
%}

{% style %}
  .ai-blog-insights-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background }};
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: 24px;
    padding-right: 24px;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.heading_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 64px;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-title-line1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-title-accent-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-title-line2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-blog-visible-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-grid-3col-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-grid-4col-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-grid-horizontal-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-decoration: none;
    scroll-snap-align: start;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 230px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-blog-insights-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    left: 16px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: capitalize;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 24px;
    flex-grow: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-date-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.date_color }};
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-read-more-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-blog-insights-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-blog-insights-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-blog-insights-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-left: 20px;
      padding-right: 20px;
    }

    .ai-blog-insights-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 48px;
    }

    .ai-blog-insights-grid-3col-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-blog-insights-grid-4col-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .ai-blog-insights-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .ai-blog-insights-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-blog-insights-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-left: 16px;
      padding-right: 16px;
    }

    .ai-blog-insights-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 34px;
    }

    .ai-blog-insights-grid-3col-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-blog-insights-grid-4col-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-blog-insights-grid-horizontal-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    }

    .ai-blog-insights-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: 220px;
    }

    .ai-blog-insights-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .ai-blog-insights-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<blog-insights-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-blog-insights-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-blog-insights-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-blog-insights-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h2 class="ai-blog-insights-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <span class="ai-blog-insights-title-line1-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading_line1 }}</span><br>
        <span class="ai-blog-insights-title-accent-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading_accent }}</span>
        <span class="ai-blog-insights-title-line2-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading_line2 }}</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    {% if selected_blog != blank %}
      {% liquid
        assign grid_class = 'ai-blog-insights-grid-3col-' | append: ai_gen_id
        if layout_type == '4col'
          assign grid_class = 'ai-blog-insights-grid-4col-' | append: ai_gen_id
        elsif layout_type == 'horizontal'
          assign grid_class = 'ai-blog-insights-grid-horizontal-' | append: ai_gen_id
        endif
      %}

      <div class="ai-blog-insights-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {{ grid_class }}" data-blog-grid>
        {% for article in selected_blog.articles limit: posts_count %}
          <a href="{{ article.url }}" class="ai-blog-insights-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="animation-delay: {{ forloop.index | times: 120 }}ms;">
            <div class="ai-blog-insights-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if article.image %}
                <img
                  src="{{ article.image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                  alt="{{ article.image.alt | escape }}"
                  class="ai-blog-insights-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="600"
                  height="400"
                >
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-blog-insights-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}

              {% if article.tags.size > 0 %}
                <div class="ai-blog-insights-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ article.tags.first }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>

            <div class="ai-blog-insights-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-blog-insights-date-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ article.published_at | date: '%B %d, %Y' }}
              </div>

              <h3 class="ai-blog-insights-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ article.title }}
              </h3>

              <div class="ai-blog-insights-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if article.excerpt != blank %}
                  {{ article.excerpt | strip_html }}
                {% else %}
                  {{ article.content | strip_html | truncate: 150 }}
                {% endif %}
              </div>

              <div class="ai-blog-insights-read-more-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                Read More
                <span class="ai-blog-insights-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">→</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <div style="text-align: center; padding: 60px 20px; color: #7B7B7B;">
        <p style="font-size: 16px; margin: 0;">Select a blog from the Theme Editor to display articles</p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</blog-insights-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class BlogInsights{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.setupIntersectionObserver();
      }

      setupIntersectionObserver() {
        const grid = this.querySelector('[data-blog-grid]');
        if (!grid) return;

        const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
          (entries) => {
            entries.forEach((entry) => {
              if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                entry.target.classList.add('ai-blog-visible-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
                observer.unobserve(entry.target);
              }
            });
          },
          {
            threshold: 0.1,
            rootMargin: '0px 0px -50px 0px'
          }
        );

        observer.observe(grid);
      }
    }

    customElements.define('blog-insights-{{ ai_gen_id }}', BlogInsights{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

